.TH KISETSU 1 "2026-11-03" "Kisetsu 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kisetsu \- wallpaper discovery and management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kisetsu
.br
.B kisetsu agent
.br
.B kisetsu rotate
.br
.B kisetsu fetch
.I NAME
.RB [ \-\-count
.IR N ]
.br
.B kisetsu version
.br
.B kisetsu help
.SH DESCRIPTION
Kisetsu searches several image sources at once, keeps a local library
of images with their author, source and license, and sets or rotates the
desktop wallpaper.
.PP
Without a command, the Kisetsu window opens.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B agent
Run in the background and change the wallpaper whenever rotation is due,
counting from the last change. If turned on in the Wallpaper tab, it also
shows the tray icon. It runs while rotation or the tray icon is on. It stops with Ctrl+C or at the end of the
session. Only one agent runs per user; starting a second one does
nothing.
.TP
.B rotate
Change the wallpaper to the next image from the source chosen in the
Wallpaper tab. The wallpaper is set directly, not through Variety.
.TP
.B rotate \-\-scheduled
The same, but only if automatic rotation is turned on. Kept for the
rotation timer of Kisetsu 0.1.0, which the window replaces with the agent
when it first opens.
.TP
.BI "fetch " NAME " \fR[\fB\-\-count \fIN\fR]"
Download up to
.I N
(1 to 24, default 5) new images for the saved search called
.I NAME
into the cache of fetched images.
.TP
.B version
Show the version.
.TP
.B help
Show a short help.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KISETSU_LOG_LEVEL
.BR debug ,
.BR info " (default),"
.B warn
or
.BR error .
At debug level, search text is written to the log.
.TP
.B KISETSU_WEBVIEW_GPU
WebView hardware acceleration:
.BR ondemand " (default),"
.B always
or
.BR never .
Use
.B never
if the window stays blank or flickers.
.TP
.BR XDG_DATA_HOME ", " XDG_CACHE_HOME ", " XDG_STATE_HOME ", " XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Change where the files below are kept.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/kisetsu
Library images, thumbnails and the database.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/kisetsu
Images fetched for saved searches (at most 200 MB).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/kisetsu/agent.lock
Held by the running agent, and holds its process ID.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/kisetsu/kisetsu.log
Log; a new one is started above 5 MB, the previous is kept as
.IR kisetsu.log.1 .
.TP
.I ~/.config/autostart/io.github.sentivanac.Kisetsu.Agent.desktop
Starts the agent at login; present only while rotation is turned on.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The wallpaper changed, or there was nothing to do (no images, rotation
turned off, another change in progress).
.TP
.B 1
Failure; details are in the log.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid usage, or no saved search with that name.
.SH NOTES
Kisetsu shows the license of every image but does not make images free
to use. Check the license on the source page before publishing an image.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR variety (1)
.PP
https://github.com/sentivanac/kisetsu
